        "answer": {
          "short": "$4x^2-y^2+2yz-z^2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(2x-y+z)(2x+y-z)&=(2x)^2-(y-z)^2\\\\(2x-y+z)(2x+y-z)&=4x^2-(y^2-2yz+z^2)\\\\(2x-y+z)(2x+y-z)&=4x^2-y^2+2yz-z^2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p27-q13-d",
